      "title": "Russell Brand suspected to have attacked at least 10 other women",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2026/nov/06/russell-brand-trial-other-women",
      "description": "<p>Met police chief says ‘many more’ victims could come forward, as actor and comedian awaits sentencing </p><p>Police are bracing themselves for more victims of Russell Brand to come forward, with at least 10 more women suspected of having been attacked by the disgraced star.</p><p>Brand, 51, will be sentenced on Monday to what is expected to be a lengthy jail sentence for rape and sexual assaults after he abused his fame to become a “predator” targeting women, and got away with it for years.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2026/nov/06/russell-brand-trial-other-women\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-07T00:00:47"
    },
    {
      "title": "Russell Brand barrister reports himself to watchdog over clash with journalist",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2026/nov/06/russell-brand-barrister-ian-winter-reports-himself-bar-watchdog-confronting-sunday-times-journalist",
      "description": "<p>Ian Winter KC told Rosamund Urwin of the Sunday Times, whose investigation led to Brand’s victims coming forward: ‘I hope you are pleased with yourself’</p><p>Russell Brand’s barrister has reported himself to his professional regulator after being accused of launching a tirade at a journalist shortly after his client had been found guilty of rape.</p><p>Ian Winter KC “confronted” the Sunday Times journalist Rosamund Urwin, whose investigation led to <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/nov/06/met-police-chief-potential-victims-russell-brand-come-forward\">Brand’s victims</a> coming forward, telling her: “I hope you are pleased with yourself.”</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2026/nov/06/russell-brand-barrister-ian-winter-reports-himself-bar-watchdog-confronting-sunday-times-journalist\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-06T19:59:23"
    }
